  "7d210099-53d4-5c49-99fb-32b5601984e0"],
 "\[LineSeparator]returns the facet automorphic group of the clique complex \
given as a list ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["facetsLst", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "e1f34298-f7d2-0a4e-b9ab-6e67031e7771"],
 " of maximal cliques. It does not check whether or not the complex is a \
clique complex."
}], "Usage",
